      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: \"in\" is probably not necessary since String is immutable / can\u0027t be an output.\n\nAlthough, do you think the config file should be always visible to virtmanaager? An alternative would be the use a Parcelable.  We may also avoid parsing untrusted input in this process.",
