        "id": 1042276
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-04T18:49:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe it\u0027s time us all of us to converge on the style.  So far I\u0027ve trying to use camelCase / following the other .aidls.  I wonder if we should do the same here, especially since we\u0027re generating Java API.  WDYT?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 22,
        "startChar": 24,
        "endLine": 22,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "6a45c9beca3d7415d20d0bd63c5c79a38e83b519",
