      "writtenOn": "2021-02-05T18:57:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "RE in/String: \"Primitives, String, IBinder, and AIDL-generated interfaces are in by default, and cannot be otherwise.\" according to https://developer.android.com/guide/components/aidl\n\nRE file visibility: the API is currently \"unstable\", so it\u0027s semantically fine to land this first.  I think we can\u0027t avoid thinking about this, since we\u0027ll have to add some new sepolicy rules later to allow reading from specific file contexts.",
      "parentUuid": "c03fb405_f3f3f0e4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 22,
        "startChar": 33,
        "endLine": 22,
        "endChar": 35
