      "writtenOn": "2021-02-05T18:57:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can\u0027t find any, but AIDL is pretty Java-centric from what I can tell.  For example, \"All primitive types in the Java programming language\"[1], and the type names are Java-ish (e.g. char, boolean, CharSequence).  That\u0027s why I feel it makes more sense to keep .aidl in Java style.  Hope that make sense?\n\n[1] https://developer.android.com/guide/components/aidl",
      "parentUuid": "7db1ee74_55aee7c3",
      "range": {
